                <l xml:id="m-207ae904-4b6a-4e1a-a86a-1b7a226bc019" facs="#m-aa74ed47-cec2-4411-81f0-ecfe5f70a285" label="ambiguous">1oi2</l><l xml:id="m-540ed876-0158-4730-bea6-1364bc46be70" facs="#m-b2f9f97f-9d70-45d8-ac4e-1c3bd825c842" label="text-like">7th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-37d22866-c238-42ed-8b95-511b05e36b7a" facs="#m-38e66e02-3184-4208-91f7-ba003c8193c5" label="ambiguous">onert.</l><l xml:id="m-25493ad3-99ae-402c-9534-ad4a4864ad78" facs="#m-027e4310-4dd1-44fc-aa0f-6b711074736c" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-50b6a5af-6572-4d37-933a-428385ef0f2d" facs="#m-4e8c8707-990a-45f8-b8ab-e5ac37445299" label="lyrics-like">Ic-ut * in ho-locáu-sto a-¬ e- tum et tau¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ec93a53-535f-4af3-9385-6d3a00c7fe98" facs="#m-3fbeeea3-ec66-4948-93a3-84699d685d2e" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-1687596a-2daf-481c-97a1-2f3673875689" facs="#m-137530c9-e51f-4e3b-9da7-0e56dace40e7" label="lyrics-like">ró- rum, et sic- ut in mil- li- bus agnó- rum pín¬</l><l xml:id="m-85d74a35-7de4-4eab-9353-0f151815e539" facs="#m-0cd90732-cdab-4c17-941f-3fc734cf8ff0" label="lyrics-like">gui¬ um: sic fi- at sacri-fí-ci¬</l><l xml:id="m-234af580-1c49-48dd-ac52-9587674cbb75" facs="#m-944445bb-4c58-4c36-8c8d-d3f579819998" label="lyrics-like">um nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a84ee2f8-293d-4ec2-bbd3-f08beb196eeb" facs="#m-4a998795-90b4-4d15-a488-9148185bd49f" label="lyrics-like">ut plá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ff486a8-2126-4ca1-b43a-458d421467c1" facs="#m-991da23f-f3e2-4d17-873e-978334d1fe6f" label="lyrics-like">hó- di-e,</l><l xml:id="m-6599f76f-3155-4020-a0ca-35368b872d95" facs="#m-f1c82cf2-1b46-41b0-b953-84b73f4326e2" label="lyrics-like">strum in conspé-ctu tú¬ </l><l xml:id="m-fa3e1554-2ef3-4a0d-b478-19cbd2c606c1" facs="#m-272f4168-092f-4ba5-b0cb-5c058edcca6d" label="lyrics-like">ce-at tí- bi: qui-a non</l><l xml:id="m-b9a72454-23a1-46b5-802c-e858f8ce10d8" facs="#m-7f286cca-6ec5-4525-a472-044d423a5f49" label="lyrics-like">est confú-si¬</l><l xml:id="m-694a14c1-a30b-484f-b97a-8abbc2ec4438" facs="#m-bcf59b49-eca6-466d-ae7a-513f1cf25a06" label="ambiguous">confi¬</l><l xml:id="m-561ca973-8e6c-48ad-9e69-fc44d6893ef2" facs="#m-f9aaae7b-f91e-4b7d-ab5f-f13bf626d495" label="lyrics-like">déntibus in te Dómi¬ ne.</l><l xml:id="m-935e8e3b-ec61-471c-ae1a-c75a324fbd35" facs="#m-8f02892a-53a1-4632-b861-3838c74ba564" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b1eafa0e-c7af-4464-8fce-c7d9bd31391d" facs="#m-07ea5d36-b157-4488-a14a-c29ccd6c89f3" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui legálium differéntiam dictióne, sicut múnera Abel, san¬</l><l xml:id="m-2bebd7d8-8ca8-4c9a-a6a6-62c7dc216652" facs="#m-4ed81e63-406b-427f-aa58-1157be3e4540" label="lyrics-like">A hostiárum, únius sacrificii per¬</l><l xml:id="m-c52917dc-f866-413c-b1a4-bf385bd9155c" facs="#m-a5a1f0d1-2606-4130-baa1-0eadfd4fff49" label="lyrics-like">ctifica: ut, quod singuli obtuiérunt</l><l xml:id="m-948a0e5a-436b-40b6-b4e2-502384c4d917" facs="#m-9ae53f19-c201-4c8b-8884-50058e7a3781" label="lyrics-like">fectióne sanxísti : áccipe sacrificium</l><l xml:id="m-a3d9710e-07a9-4f77-8ae7-64d6ce0dc029" facs="#m-294c8052-0a64-47dc-8963-ff840fa2afd7" label="lyrics-like">ad majestátis tuae honórem, cunctis</l><l xml:id="m-0ce83797-ffd4-45b2-99b0-450796687664" facs="#m-5acf1afe-d205-41e5-bab2-56c1ded2aad0" label="lyrics-like">a devótis tibi fámulis, et pari bene-proficiat ad salútem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-72cc7f34-4af7-4c34-9ed9-f4f890e7fe28" facs="#m-dc199ba1-4e4a-4de6-8b18-994d8f19cef5" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-cf615cb3-f76d-477a-ab7d-4a349c17f4ad" facs="#m-84b3fef4-df03-40a3-967c-a848dd1d28da" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-d162eab6-3162-457b-83de-dad3d5e7b67f" facs="#m-6cf1fa91-ba7b-48bb-a3d9-c17277f17648" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-a7d99d58-2674-4126-a0c3-472a0a0c9c0c" facs="#m-41eb48ce-bb66-4eca-96b6-0b6f4ef91219" label="lyrics-like">LNclí-na “ áurem tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-31604e50-172b-41fe-bc76-878954210e14" facs="#m-79afb949-0d8d-4f86-8571-fff130d4c090" label="ambiguous">ut</l><l xml:id="m-432c829e-09a6-4ee4-a37a-d068450b6bf3" facs="#m-454b242c-1c7b-4d6f-9949-683120f6f37b" label="lyrics-like">am, accé-le¬ ra,</l><l xml:id="m-6670b102-99f2-4efc-a0aa-12d73333ddbd" facs="#m-2d85f81a-586a-4cd2-b8e7-89e1deb10eb7" label="lyrics-like">é- ru-as nos.</l><l xml:id="m-7ca02cfd-9069-40e3-bd1f-6cceac2f8a80" facs="#m-c323f483-e8b7-4c28-b247-b5df04546e30" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-b8c2c11e-d18f-4d46-a647-fe75d96402aa" facs="#m-634aeb7d-dc54-4503-9f7c-1ab61e74b233" label="lyrics-like">UA nos, Dómine, medicinális! ea quae sunt recta, perdúcat. Per</l><l xml:id="m-bd402f04-fa8d-4b7f-a17b-9aeced5f8917" facs="#m-fb8b949b-e0b0-4587-8103-77042ed4efda" label="lyrics-like">A operátio, et a nostris perversi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b751b37-00b0-4285-8cb0-c6a407e5d4b3" facs="#m-136f6e69-2586-4b8e-8f1d-f41cccea4aa7" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-dac87fd0-7a8c-4f63-a564-edf2da10b4d1" facs="#m-68889ba6-4435-463c-be95-eb98da525e06" label="lyrics-like">tátibus cleménter expédiat, et ad</l><l xml:id="m-d9e301ae-bb2f-4944-b1e1-510d9943de0c" facs="#m-46208ea8-1902-4204-a764-95923a3f6b97" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 5 Atthe priest's choice.</l></lg>
